Required plan revisions: none. Broader required design findings: none. The specialist's concrete native seam limitations are incorporated as owned Task 1 work with execution obligations, rather than mislabeled as solved.

The current validation index correctly leaves implementation/entry-point parity, preservation, portability/hooks and broad qualification unproved. Its design-review-pending wording predates the available specialist reports; refreshing that progress wording is routine evidence-index upkeep, not a change to this reviewed plan or a completion failure. The separate source implementation and actual caller demonstrations must still occur before Stage 1 PR handoff and Stage 2/3 completion. Reuse this review only while this plan/source identity and governing requirements remain applicable; recheck substantive plan changes if introduced.

